      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4dbd92d77eb38a73ba64d26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你们见识见识目白家的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b9a565d4b1fd96eed15b063e9394aa6eb60890a5678a3b8e9dbf91ce423c7a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baf1571f02391df93d1fa60a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我列了一张清单，\r\n海边、游泳池……该从哪项开始呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "abc5ad6a286494cdda02b9f5c67fa0f8d6d93f10dfae76643c38f7bd09bac9e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce2901f1d8d49265914d11a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实我对水上摩托车有点兴趣……\r\n只、只是稍微有兴趣而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6411c5e30e37f68e1f35c6e0ea492d797b13e6a5ccd27b1fe9a5720be86e6be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c2a5744fa12461d126b2214",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08c90c8712db9419e0438b09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很乐意接受挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "520a55e103a4a55c68b8fcdb75a8640248840ab2d5e28bb7cd7c5ec9de08d05e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a141fb4016cc80da89b21c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我决不退让……\r\n我目白家可不是浪得虚名的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "554133fef7c71200b0fcc2a7a3e64beb9ef33368e8b4685770fe1c233836239a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdc1d9de0708c0cd2bea5a69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安。\r\n我会绷紧神经，让今天\r\n成为美好的一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d709c43b58bbcae99946904a5cf93917bf9dbb32e412cde8ef39c22e4eff6b62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a827e6b6797dcfcb49708428",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都说「早起的鸟儿有虫吃」，\r\n真想要好好利用早上的时间呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "571ffe3783d47285d0efaa1d5508cca754267d9cd1f1e837334f6540344c2e0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79bab529dfa114306e909836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午安。\r\n一起优雅地度过午后时光吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "785ecbe39980fbcce3a932781adb1f85456b9385418d4620666f007978a9f958",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a98291c82aa41a2979f78a56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每到中午的时候，就会想要吃甜食，\r\n但为了维持体型也只能忍耐了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0974e459bf5f4fa6a5324e480dc3f3c7c17fefe089ef0e98b6a88814b3551e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcaf70cdf815508dbd4c93e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。\r\n请你务必要保重身体，\r\n不要过于劳累了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e44ac1d5532a59121505d050feeb0674c66f6b22c127374cd58d126dedc9204",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a5508da1364a4a25f975c2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是晚上我也绝不会松懈的。\r\n我还可以继续撑着……",
      "source_fingerprint": "df6499e23c70752fc282c233023f38ced5967550d3a41f1154156feaebf9ef2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e26d73673a4fc366e4fb6934",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着五颜六色盛开的花，\r\n就会觉得心情也跟着丰富了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2591c2d90537e0233ffa9e84d6b2bf7845eae5f07d023f174f7036e6d925d31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f565939db9cb622fae13c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时期一定要随身携带手帕呢……\r\n可不能让大家看到我难堪的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "067d0a9f76aadb724dd8e5ab0c303d0283cdab980fa90e05e79a4bd580ae7ff3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b8ab382d43d4650496da7f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "相对来说，我比较不适应秋天呢……\r\n也许是因为换季的时候\r\n很容易生病的关系吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95fb9220bd114648db9778b128431dcdca403736b211683483d7644eef85d27a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f40b796738666161a4880264",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体觉得很寒冷呢……\r\n从脖子到手指都要做好防寒措施才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "798c980eb3388c6b7c338f56d1fd2745e433770d82d18c0f19d3223bab4177ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90009"
      ]
    }
  ]
